If a clinician prescribes an opioid-prescription for an acute-pain then the clinician should review a state-PDMP-record before the opioid-prescription.
If a clinician prescribes an opioid-prescription for a subacute-pain then the clinician should review a state-PDMP-record before the opioid-prescription.
If a clinician prescribes an opioid-prescription for a chronic-pain then the clinician should review a state-PDMP-record before the opioid-prescription.
